1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,343
The leftover pyruvate goes back to the mesophyll and is turned into PEP again, at a cost of two more ATP.

2
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:14,895
So a C4 plant pays five ATP per carbon dioxide instead of three: thirty per glucose instead of eighteen.

3
00:00:14,895 --> 00:00:18,111
On a hot, bright day it is well worth it.

